# contracts/omega.contract: what aien-sovereign-core uses of omega, and the check that proves it.
# Read by the aien-sovereign-core repo agent (tools/aien-board, docs/REPO_AGENTS.md) from this
# repository's main, never from a producer change. An omega post on the change board needs this
# check exactly when one of its changed paths is under a watch line below; otherwise the answer is SKIP.
producer omega
pin omega.lock
# The rxc_host C ABI and the build that makes librx_compose.a (crates/aien-omega-compose/build.rs).
watch src/runtime/rxc_host_abi.h
watch src/runtime/rxc_host_abi.c
watch Makefile
watch mk/
watch physics.lock
watch aienos.lock
# Every omega source and header the library is compiled from, learned by the check from the
# objects' dependency files (scripts/contract-omega.sh writes watch.learned; refresh with a PR).
watch-file contracts/omega.watch
check scripts/contract-omega.sh
timeout 40m
